  },
  "scale": {
   "note": "photo - per-axis anchoring of the front photograph (body between the ear wings anchored to 445 mm; rows to 88.9). Positions are single-pass readings approximate to ~2 mm"
  },
  "shared-chassis": {
   "note": "guide - the MX5, MX10, MX40 and MX80 are one chassis with different capacity licences and MIC entitlements (guide Figures 5-9); they are modelled as ONE device with the SKUs as configurations. The FIXED MX80 variant (Figure 8, 48x1GbE built in) is a different faceplate and is not modelled - see gaps"
  },
  "sources": {
   "note": "MX5/MX10/MX40/MX80 Hardware Guide, and the image-library photographs mx80-front-high and mx80-rear-high (the mx5 set is the same base asset, recorded in the photo catalogue). No mechanical drawing was available"
